e default and therefore what every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"row written before T21.4 decodes to, which is the truth: they were all created through "},{"code":"POST \/oauth2-clients","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" by somebody holding "},{"code":"oauth2_clients:create","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","title":"ManagedBy","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ManagedBy"}]}}}